  "content": "\n\n# 音乐盒\n\n![锥子，音符格，音乐盒](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/iVwaeEOr/images/7f0ab47113791bacae645676b6657868cabfc626.png)\n\n**在音符格上打孔谱写乐曲，并用音乐盒播放！**\n\n## 预览\n\n<iframe width=\"960\" height=\"540\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/vhnUDJIjIXs\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n↑ 欣赏音乐。\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/iVwaeEOr/images/ff5dfa856487b49b26a759345560adf9e3b5a0d9.gif\" width = \"960\" height = \"540\" alt=\"自动化\"/>\n\n↑ 使用比较器根据音符格的内容输出不同的信号。\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/iVwaeEOr/images/ae9e467fac6ff0ab7d7f58ed48b3432d51a17d95.gif\" width = \"960\" height = \"540\" alt=\"打孔\"/>\n\n↑ 在打孔台上为音符格打孔。\n\n# 详情见 [GitHub](https://github.com/C20C01/MusicBox/blob/main/README.md)\n\n# 尽情游玩😘",
